.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH orbit-guide 1  "guide " 
.SH NAME
orbit\-guide \- Print a short reference: commands, refs, listings, JSON shapes and exit codes
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBorbit guide\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print a short reference: commands, refs, listings, JSON shapes and exit codes
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print one JSON object per result, with `"v":1`, instead of text
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  orbit guide
  orbit \-\-json guide
